@server = http://localhost:4004
@hr = {{server}}/odata/v4/hr

### 1. Alice (Employee) sees only her own leave requests
GET {{hr}}/LeaveRequests
Authorization: Basic alice:alice

### 2. Bob (Manager) sees all employees
GET {{hr}}/Employees?$select=firstName,lastName,department
Authorization: Basic bob:bob

### 3. Alice creates a leave request (days is calculated for her)
POST {{hr}}/LeaveRequests
Authorization: Basic alice:alice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "startDate": "2027-01-12",
  "endDate": "2027-01-14",
  "reason": "Wedding in the family"
}

### 4. A wrong date is rejected (end before start)
POST {{hr}}/LeaveRequests
Authorization: Basic alice:alice
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "employee_ID": "a1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
  "startDate": "2027-02-10",
  "endDate": "2027-02-08",
  "reason": "Oops"
}

### 5. Alice tries to approve: 403 Forbidden
POST {{hr}}/LeaveRequests(b1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)/approve
Authorization: Basic alice:alice
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 6. Bob (Manager) approves
POST {{hr}}/LeaveRequests(b1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)/approve
Authorization: Basic bob:bob
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 7. Check the new status
GET {{hr}}/LeaveRequests(b1b2c3d4-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)?$select=reason,status
Authorization: Basic bob:bob
